GPUI.NET

This project uses GPUI Kit and its gpui-base layer as a design and
implementation reference for native component behavior, retained interaction
state, input editing, focus/IME behavior, overlay/tooltip geometry and timing, virtualization,
motion, theming boundaries, accessibility, and component composition:

    https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit

